{"4193590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Salvation Denied", "steam_appid": 4193590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op that is funny and tense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/96c08856bc40fd56677d487e668d3883.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/96c08856bc40fd56677d487e668d3883.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/96c08856bc40fd56677d487e668d3883.mp4?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a game about teamwork, chaos, shouting in voice chat, and shared failures. One wrong move and the whole team pays for it. But when everything clicks, the feeling of &quot;we did this together&quot; is hard to beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build by the laws of physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/f0af1c486947f23c7ae5a053b902cb3e.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/f0af1c486947f23c7ae5a053b902cb3e.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/f0af1c486947f23c7ae5a053b902cb3e.mp4?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every object has weight and inertia and affects the stability of the structure. Mistakes are not forgiven. An overloaded support, bad balance, or a rushed decision – and everything falls apart. Physics is not decoration here. It is the main judge. When your construction holds, the victory feels truly earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personal construction gadgets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/27d30b23ad9d757941fa3cfe0e358001.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/27d30b23ad9d757941fa3cfe0e358001.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/27d30b23ad9d757941fa3cfe0e358001.mp4?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity gun, foam gun, jetpack, and other tools. Every player has a role on the site. Move across the structure, throw parts, create temporary supports, and hold it all together at the last second. Team coordination decides everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>With great power comes great responsibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/ce58b0d0712ce1d9c83589f781c3e68a.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/ce58b0d0712ce1d9c83589f781c3e68a.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/ce58b0d0712ce1d9c83589f781c3e68a.mp4?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of massive construction machines. A gravity tank, a giant shredder bulldozer, or a levitating platform. Lift entire building sections, recycle debris, hold the structure together, and deal with threats right in the middle of the disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different locations. Completely different challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/626863ac226c1b069642530800c21e87.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/626863ac226c1b069642530800c21e87.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/626863ac226c1b069642530800c21e87.mp4?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location is a new scenario with its own objective, its own rules, and its own way to fail. The tools stay the same. The teamwork stays the same. Everything else changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cataclysms as a test for your build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/47b2b2f9bf2976df980b38dcf0035774.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/47b2b2f9bf2976df980b38dcf0035774.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/47b2b2f9bf2976df980b38dcf0035774.mp4?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The disaster is not a cutscene. It is an active stress test for everything your team has built. Every location has its own brand of chaos – a meteor shower, or something worse. Reinforce weak spots on the fly, react fast, and keep it all together under pressure. The chaos quickly shows who can actually build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op that is funny and tense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/96c08856bc40fd56677d487e668d3883.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/96c08856bc40fd56677d487e668d3883.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/96c08856bc40fd56677d487e668d3883.mp4?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a game about teamwork, chaos, shouting in voice chat, and shared failures. One wrong move and the whole team pays for it. But when everything clicks, the feeling of &quot;we did this together&quot; is hard to beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build by the laws of physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/f0af1c486947f23c7ae5a053b902cb3e.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/f0af1c486947f23c7ae5a053b902cb3e.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; c